OL,3,GNEWSAMile challenge for man told he
OL,4,Awould never walk again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Newcastle United supporter who was
OL,7,Ftold he would never walk again has
OL,8,Fcompleted a mile-long walking
OL,9,Fchallenge.
OL,11,FKeith Dungait suffered a spinal injury
OL,12,Fafter hitting his head in a swimming
OL,13,Fpool, but decided to take on the Alan
OL,14,FShearer Foundation's Move a Mile
OL,15,Fcampaign.
OL,17,FManaging about 50 steps a day in his
OL,18,Fgarden using his walking frame, he
OL,19,Fcompleted his target in just a few
OL,20,Fweeks, raising almost #3,000 for the
OL,21,Fcharity.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
